told anyone this yet, but --"

00:00:07.067 --> 00:00:08.501
-You were the first person
I told.

00:00:08.501 --> 00:00:09.567
-I was, right?
-Yeah.

00:00:09.567 --> 00:00:10.834
-"I'm getting my own show."

00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:12.534
