00:02:04.767 --> 00:02:06.367
-Karamo. I'm doing Karamo.
You know what I mean?

00:02:06.367 --> 00:02:08.868
-Ah, of course.

00:02:08.868 --> 00:02:10.300
That's a good --
That's the right answer.

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:12.667
-That's what it is.
For me, my whole life has been

00:02:12.667 --> 00:02:14.634
about helping people
and making people be better.

00:02:14.634 --> 00:02:16.267
Like, that's why I went into
social services.

00:02:16.267 --> 00:02:17.767
That's what I've always done.

00:02:17.767 --> 00:02:19.200
That's what I did on
"Queer Eye."

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:22.267
And so every day, people who
need help can come on my show

00:02:22.267 --> 00:02:24.334
with their family members,
with whomever.

00:02:24.334 --> 00:02:26.167
Y'all got conflict, come to me.

00:02:26.167 --> 00:02:27.767
I'm going to give you advice.
I'm going to help you,

00:02:27.767 --> 00:02:29.467
and then afterward we're going
to twerk it out a little bit.

00:02:29.467 --> 00:02:32.534
Hey.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:32.534 --> 00:02:34.000
We'll twerk it out a little bit.

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:37.000
-So it's fun, but it's also --
Do you tackle serious issues?

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:38.200
-Yeah, we tackle
the serious issues.

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:39.434
It's all about, like, whatever
is going on

00:02:39.434 --> 00:02:40.868
in your family life, your drama,

00:02:40.868 --> 00:02:42.734
I can help you solve it.
I'm good at that.

00:02:42.734 --> 00:02:45.067
You would imagine, like --
I have people coming to me like,

00:02:45.067 --> 00:02:47.033
"We haven't talked in 20 years."
And by the end of my segment,

00:02:47.033 --> 00:02:48.868
