is showing.

00:02:59.100 --> 00:03:00.534
That was your influence,
and I appreciate you for that.

00:03:00.534 --> 00:03:02.534
-Oh, come on, bud.
You got to have fun.

00:03:02.534 --> 00:03:03.601
-Yeah, yeah.

00:03:03.601 --> 00:03:05.400
-People can tell
